			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721070101,
					"content": "狐狸神像…沒錯，跟紺田村那時一樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070102,
					"content": "但是，好像沒見到神像裡有鎮物…還是說，被什麼東西藏起來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070103,
					"content": "該不會又有什麼麻煩的<color=#00E1FFFF>秘密</color>吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070104,
						721070106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070104,
					"content": "我們的配合…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070105,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我們真是好搭檔。村長爺爺什麼都說了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070107,
					"content": "等等！這裡有一行小字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070108,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>「鎮物以言靈封印至此。」</color>",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070109,
					"content": "咦？這是什麼意思？邊邊還寫了什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070110,
					"content": "「雖然我希望封印不要有解開的一天，雖然你也已經多年不曾有音訊。但如果一定要解開封印，實行大祓的話，那希望解開封印的人是你。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070111,
					"content": "「第三句言靈是以前你常說的話。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070112,
						721070113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070112,
					"content": "好難懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070114,
					"content": "我看看…「如果是小生的繼任者的話，要解開言靈之前，還有這麼一個步驟。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070115,
					"content": "「御靈有四魂，巴有三重。據此我留下了<color=#00E1FFFF>三名式神</color>看守。<color=#00E1FFFF>當它們匯聚在一起時</color>，才能繼續。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070116,
					"content": "「雖然這重鎖沒什麼用，但要擋住沒什麼能耐的賊人大抵是綽綽有餘」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070117,
					"content": "…欸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070118,
					"content": "怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070119,
					"content": "那我們一定得想辦法解決才行了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070120,
					"content": "不然我們就是「沒什麼能耐的賊人」了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070113,
					"content": "還有嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070106,
					"content": "希望不要有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070107
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7210702,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721070201,
					"content": "這樣就可以了！好累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070202,
					"content": "明明累的是我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070203,
					"content": "不要在意這種細節。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070204,
					"content": "嗯，裡面好像有本書…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070205,
					"content": "哇，好難讀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070206,
					"content": "大概看過一遍了，但又好像完全沒有看懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070207,
					"content": "算了，我們還是去找專業人士問問看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070208,
					"content": "既然是神神鬼鬼的東西…那去鳴神大社吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7210703,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7210707
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7210705",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7210705,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7210707",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7210707,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"稻城螢美"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721070301,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}好，遠道而來的旅者，歡迎來到「鳴神大社」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070302,
					"content": "#如果有煩惱或者心願，可以找玄冬小姐求籤，雷神會保佑{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070303,
					"content": "原來如此，情況我已大致瞭解了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070304,
					"content": "「神櫻大祓」之事，是很重要的儀式。確實有相關的記載…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070305,
					"content": "不過？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070306,
					"content": "#不過，如今具體的行事方法已經失傳了。{F#妳}{M#你}手中的《要略》，是很寶貴的史料呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070307,
					"content": "失傳了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070308,
					"content": "難道是愚人眾幹的？既然稻城小姐說是重要的事情，就很難不覺得他們在背後搞鬼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070309,
					"content": "啊，不是的。是因為保存不當。受潮、蟲蛀等。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070310,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070311,
					"content": "哎呀，真是相當遺憾。有很多史料都丟失了呢。之前八重大人和神里大人也為此很苦惱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070312,
					"content": "至於「言靈」之事，我也並非一無所知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070313,
					"content": "嗯嗯，那就請把破解的方法告訴我們吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070314,
					"content": "很抱歉，將鎮物封印的「言靈咒法」並非特定咒語。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070315,
					"content": "…而是施咒者釋術時親自擬定的單語，也即言靈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070316,
					"content": "啊？妳的意思是說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070317,
					"content": "咒語…是那個施咒者隨隨便便拍腦袋想的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070318,
					"content": "也並非如此。此類言靈一般都有其規律。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070319,
					"content": "能否詳細說說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070320,
					"content": "嗯…我記得書中是這麼記載的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070321,
					"content": "第一句表示自身在稻妻的威名。是什麼什麼加上「敕使」二字來著…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070322,
					"content": "第二句則是解釋自己自身力量的來源。打個比方，就像「糰子」、「拉麵」、「輕小說」之類的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070323,
					"content": "嗯嗯我懂。確實是很了不起的力量來源呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070324,
					"content": "只是打個比方啦。記載裡，有類似「陰陽博曉」之類的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070325,
					"content": "至於這第三句…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070326,
						721070327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070326,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070328
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070328,
					"content": "#嗯…如{F#妳}{M#你}所料。第三句的內容可以自由發揮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070329,
					"content": "時隔久遠，恐怕這世上已經沒有瞭解第三句話的知情人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070330,
					"content": "那要怎麼辦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070331,
					"content": "面具巫女姐姐的託付…還有這片大地…都要完蛋了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070332,
						721070333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070332,
					"content": "別緊張…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070334
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070334,
					"content": "嗯，這個小東西，或許能夠幫上二位的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070335,
					"content": "這是<color=#00E1FFFF>「留念鏡」</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070336,
					"content": "「留念」？是紀念品的意思嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070337,
					"content": "二位博見廣識，想必對「留影機」有所瞭解吧。那是異國楓丹生產的，可以記錄影像的器物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070338,
					"content": "在遙遠的過去，離島方才建設不久時，當時的柊家家主弘嗣大人曾經從異國引進諸多新奇產品，以此證明他力推建設通商港能帶來的裨益。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070339,
					"content": "譬如說，利用從至冬國購進的「高爐」，將毗鄰天守的柊家舊宅改造成「溫泉」，以此作為對大御所大人恩准的感念，贈給大御所大人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070340,
					"content": "又以那位「狐齋宮大人」曾贈予柊家的退邪之鏡為「透鏡」，從楓丹國訂做了一台特殊的留影機，能夠記錄思念與記憶，作為珍重情誼的表現，回贈大社。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070341,
					"content": "隨著年月，留影機本身失去了功能。唯獨狐齋宮大人祝福過的透鏡，在特殊的地方仍然能看見如今已經不在的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070342
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070342,
					"content": "我們將透鏡取出，名之為「留念鏡」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070343,
					"content": "#聽二位是為「櫻」之事奔走，交談中也能感覺出{F#妳}{M#你}們值得信任。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070344,
					"content": "將它託付給二位，也算能夠物盡其用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070345
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070345,
					"content": "這麼重要的東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070346
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070346,
					"content": "#二位來自異鄉吧。{F#妳}{M#你}們知道，稻妻人相信萬物有靈，石頭與樹也有記憶。而器物閒置百年，也會產生不甘的情感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070347,
					"content": "與其任由它沉睡在大社當中，不如交由有緣之人，讓它見識一下這麼數百年間變化的世界吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070348,
					"content": "沒問題！包在我們身上了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070349
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070349,
					"content": "傳說當年狐齋宮大人消失後，她在鳴神島的眷屬<color=#00E1FFFF>「地狐」</color>在各處化為假寐的雕像，等待她的歸來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070350
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070350,
					"content": "如果看見造型奇異的、小小的狐狸雕像的話…透過<color=#00E1FFFF>「留念鏡」</color>觀察它們，或許就能發現平時看不見的事物吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070351,
						721070352
					],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070351,
					"content": "多謝了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070353
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070353,
					"content": "雷神保佑，就有勞兩位了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "稻城螢美"
				},
				{
					"id": 721070352,
					"content": "包在我們身上！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070353
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070333,
					"content": "她還有話沒說完…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070334
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721070327,
					"content": "是隨隨便便拍腦袋想的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721070328
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7210704,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
